          <declname>resource</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Get a mipmapped array through which to access a mapped graphics resource. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Returns in <computeroutput>*mipmappedArray</computeroutput> a mipmapped array through which the mapped graphics resource <computeroutput>resource</computeroutput> may be accessed. The value set in <computeroutput>mipmappedArray</computeroutput> may change every time that <computeroutput>resource</computeroutput> is mapped.</para>
<para>If <computeroutput>resource</computeroutput> is not a texture then it cannot be accessed via an array and ::cudaErrorUnknown is returned. If <computeroutput>resource</computeroutput> is not mapped then ::cudaErrorUnknown is returned.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>mipmappedArray</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>- Returned mipmapped array through which <computeroutput>resource</computeroutput> may be accessed </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>resource</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>- Mapped resource to access</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>::cudaSuccess, ::cudaErrorInvalidValue, ::cudaErrorInvalidResourceHandle, ::cudaErrorUnknown \notefnerr \note_init_rt \note_callback</para>
</simplesect>
